#20400
The Hill Road~
   The road from the battlefield climbs into hills of coarse grey grass.
Burial mounds rise on every slope, hundreds of them, ringed with standing
stones. Many have been broken open, their stone doors cast down, and paths
of trampled grass lead away from them in every direction.
~
