#20401
A Broken Barrow~
   A mound has been split open like a burst fruit. Its stone door lies
shattered in the grass, and the passage behind it gapes, breathing cold air.
Grave goods are scattered across the slope: bronze cups, beads, a little
clay horse. Whatever lay inside did not stop to take them.
~
