#20403
The Crossing of Stones~
   Four roads meet in a hollow between hills, marked by a cairn of white
stones taller than a man. Offerings have been left on it for centuries:
coins, bread, little bone charms. Someone has knocked the top off the cairn
and painted the stones beneath it grey.
