#20404
The Grave Robbers' Camp~
   A camp of tents and dug-outs in the lee of a big barrow, where grave
robbers came to loot the opened tombs. Picks and shovels lie everywhere. So
do the robbers, or what is left of them, and some of what is left is still
digging.
