#20406
The Tomb of the Spiral Queen~
   A round chamber beneath the mound, its walls lined with gold leaf and
carved with a queen surrounded by kneeling figures. Her stone coffin stands
open. She sits on its edge, mummified and jewelled, combing her long dry
hair, and she smiles at you with teeth like brown pegs.
