#20408
The Bone Hollow~
   At the end of the dell, the ghouls have piled the bones of their meals
into a mound of their own, a mockery of the barrows around them. On top of
it sits the largest ghoul you have ever seen, cracking a thighbone and
sucking out the marrow.
