#20409
The Road to the Monastery~
   A paved road climbs a steep hill toward a walled monastery, its stone
walls lit by a ring of torches that never go out. Bodies lie along the road,
wrapped in white and laid in neat rows: the dead the monks have put to rest,
awaiting burial in ground they have blessed.
