#20410
The Gate of the Unsleeping Flame~
   A great gate of oak bound with iron stands in the monastery wall, carved
with a single open eye surrounded by flames. Two monks in grey stand at it
with staves, and above them on the wall more monks pace with torches,
chanting. The chant never stops.
