#20413
The Chapel of the Flame~
   A tall chapel with no windows, lit by a single great flame that burns in
a bronze bowl on the altar. It has burned without fuel for six hundred
years, the monks say, and while it burns the dead of the hills cannot pass
the walls. It is smaller than it used to be.
~
