#20415
The Cloister of Graves~
   A cloister around a garth of graves, where the monks bury those they have
put to rest. Each grave has a small flame burning on it in a clay lamp. An
old monk tends the lamps, and every grave whose lamp goes out, he says, is a
grave that will open.
