#20423
Before the Great Mound~
   The Great Mound rises before you, a hill made by hands, ringed by three
circles of stones. Its great stone door has been pushed outward from within
and lies flat on the grass. Grey light pours from the opening, and with it a
cold that freezes the breath in your throat.
