#20425
The Chamber of the Barrow King~
   A great domed chamber at the heart of the mound, heaped with gold and
bronze and bone. On a throne of stone sits the Barrow King, first lord of
the hill-folk, dead three thousand years. Grey fire burns in his eye
sockets. He has heard the voice from the West, and he has answered it.
